Hi everyone,
I am closing the vote for KIP-1276. The vote has passed.
+1 (binding): Mickael Maison, Andrew Schofield, Christo Lolov
+1 (non-binding): Federico Valeri
I will now update the KIP wiki page with the accepted status. Thank you all
for participating!
Cheers,
Maros
