Hi,
Following on from the discussion in the community, and the difficulty of tryi=
ng to accommodate the client instance ID in a tagged field with acceptable co=
mplexity, I have made a significant change to the KIP. Now, it introduces v3 =
of the request header containing the client instance ID as a proper field.

https://cwiki.apache.org/confluence/display/KAFKA/KIP-1313%3A+Client+instance=
+ID+in+all+request+headers

Please review and let me know what you think.

Thanks,
Andrew

