> I am not sure if we should apply the schedule we discussed on the =
other thread to 2025 already? Also, it's still a proposal only.

You mean 2026?

> We aim for 3 releases per year and we did already release 4.2 and 4.3 =
in 2025. Applying the discussed schedule, would imply we release 4.4 in =
September, and 4.5 in Dec, making it 4 releases, and overall squeezing =
the release timeline. I personally don't see a need for this?

We already got 4.2 and 4.3 for 2026 if we want to have 4.4 to be last =
release this year we need to push it to Oct 2026 and this will get 4.5 =
to be in Jan 2027

> Curious to hear what Omnia as RM thinks.


