Subject: [jira] [Created] (KAFKA-20679) Remove deprecated Yammer-based group
 coordinator metrics
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=utf-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: quoted-printable
X-JIRA-FingerPrint: 30527f35849b9dde25b450d4833f0394
From: "Nick Guo (Jira)" <jira@apache.org>
Reply-To: <dev@kafka.apache.org>

Nick Guo created KAFKA-20679:
--------------------------------

             Summary: Remove deprecated Yammer-based group coordinator metr=
ics
                 Key: KAFKA-20679
                 URL: https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/KAFKA-20679
             Project: Kafka
          Issue Type: Improvement
          Components: group-coordinator, metrics
            Reporter: Nick Guo
            Assignee: Nick Guo
             Fix For: 5.0.0


[KIP-1301|https://cwiki.apache.org/confluence/x/Z5U8G] deprecated several Y=
ammer-based group coordinator metrics in Kafka 4.4 and introduced equivalen=
t Kafka Metrics replacements. This issue tracks removing the deprecated Yam=
mer metrics in Kafka 5.0.

Deprecated metrics to remove:
 * kafka.coordinator.group:type=3DGroupMetadataManager,name=3DNumGroups
 * kafka.coordinator.group:type=3DGroupMetadataManager,name=3DNumOffsets
 * kafka.coordinator.group:type=3DGroupMetadataManager,name=3DNumGroupsPrep=
aringRebalance
 * kafka.coordinator.group:type=3DGroupMetadataManager,name=3DNumGroupsComp=
letingRebalance
 * kafka.coordinator.group:type=3DGroupMetadataManager,name=3DNumGroupsStab=
le
 * kafka.coordinator.group:type=3DGroupMetadataManager,name=3DNumGroupsDead
 * kafka.coordinator.group:type=3DGroupMetadataManager,name=3DNumGroupsEmpt=
y=C2=A0

Replacement Kafka Metrics:
 * kafka.server:type=3Dgroup-coordinator-metrics,name=3Dgroup-count,protoco=
l=3Dclassic
 * kafka.server:type=3Dgroup-coordinator-metrics,name=3Doffset-count
 * kafka.server:type=3Dgroup-coordinator-metrics,name=3Dclassic-group-count=
,state=3D\{PreparingRebalance|CompletingRebalance|Stable|Dead|Empty}



--
