Subject: [jira] [Created] (KAFKA-20683) Add broker side custom assignors for
 "streams" groups
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=utf-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 7bit
X-JIRA-FingerPrint: 30527f35849b9dde25b450d4833f0394
From: "Matthias J. Sax (Jira)" <jira@apache.org>
Reply-To: <dev@kafka.apache.org>

Matthias J. Sax created KAFKA-20683:
---------------------------------------

             Summary: Add broker side custom assignors for "streams" groups
                 Key: KAFKA-20683
                 URL: https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/KAFKA-20683
             Project: Kafka
          Issue Type: New Feature
          Components: group-coordinator, streams
            Reporter: Matthias J. Sax


Kafka Streams allows to implement a custom task assignor in the "classic" rebalance protocol. However, the new "streams" groups do not support custom assignors right now.

With this ticket we aim to close this gap, and add support for broker side customer assignors for "streams" groups.



--
