Hello All,

Thanks to everyone for voting. I would like to mention that the KIP
was slightly updated to address a few recent comments. These updates
explicitly document a few specific cases but do not introduce any new
code or functional changes; therefore, a new voting thread is not
required.

The vote has passed with three binding +1 votes from:
  - Matthias J. Sax
  - Bill Bejeck
  - Andrew Schofield

Thank you all for participating!

Best regards,
Uladzislau Blok


