Hi, Andrew,

Thanks for the reply. Just a minor comment.

JR26. "The keys of the map are either single versions like "0" or closed
version ranges like "1-2"."
It will be useful to support open-ended versions. That way, "3": "3" could
be "3+": "3". This part won't need to change in the future when we bump up
the request version without changing the header.

Jun

