Subject: [VOTE] KIP-1332: Dynamic memory allocation for the Kafka producer
To: dev@kafka.apache.org
Content-Type: multipart/alternative; boundary="00000000000087ed5b06545f803a"
From: Lianet Magrans <lianetm@apache.org>
Reply-To: <dev@kafka.apache.org>

--00000000000087ed5b06545f803a
Content-Type: text/plain; charset="UTF-8"

Hello,

I would like to start a vote for KIP-1332: Dynamic memory allocation for
the Kafka producer.
This KIP introduces a new opt-in memory allocation strategy for the
KafkaProducer, that allocates memory incrementally, scaling with the amount
of data produced.

KIP:
https://cwiki.apache.org/confluence/display/KAFKA/KIP-1332%3A+Dynamic+memory+allocation+for+the+Kafka+producer


Discussion thread:
https://lists.apache.org/thread/0odmbod2xh21mwr2gjt65z5qxyh41kf8

Thanks for all the feedback provided!
Lianet

--00000000000087ed5b06545f803a--

