> > > > > > >
> > > > > > > The worst-case trade-off under this invariant is bounded re-p=
rocessing
> > > > > > > proportional to the replication lag at failover time not tota=
l
> > > > > partition
> > > > > > > depth which is perfectly consistent with Kafka's documented
> > > > > at-least-once
> > > > > > > delivery guarantees. Broad enterprise production evidence fro=
