Hello!

I went through all commits which made it into this release and
adjusted the ones which were not marked with 4.3.1. The ones I found
were KAFKA-20335, KAFKA-20336 and KAFKA-20569, let me know if you
disagree with the tag.

I further ran the quickstart against both Docker images, compiled the
source and ran unit and integration tests, ran the quickstart against
the compiled binaries, verified keys and the signatures of files.

+1 (binding)

Thanks for leading the release!

Best,
Christo


