Hello all,

I would like to start a vote for KIP-1356: Introduce IQv2 for headers-aware
state stores. This KIP introduces new IQv2 query types whose results carry
headers.

KIP
<https://cwiki.apache.org/confluence/display/KAFKA/KIP-1356%3A+Introduce+IQv2+for+headers-aware+state+stores>
Discussion Thread
<https://lists.apache.org/thread/78qmd9yk2rp5cv3wwsvtwlczg5jvjd5n>

Thanks!
- Jess

