Subject: [jira] [Created] (KAFKA-20738)  Producer 2PC init sets v6-only
 InitProducerId fields but request builder caps version at v5
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=utf-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: quoted-printable
X-JIRA-FingerPrint: 30527f35849b9dde25b450d4833f0394
