>> responsibility to the caller. Refactoring the shell tool into a stateful
>> =E2=80=9Cresume=E2=80=9D CLI or a library API that streams progress even=
ts could be useful,
>> but it is a larger follow-up (new UX, persistence, idempotency) rather t=
han
